Subpart F—Special Standards of 
Diligence; Prohibitions; and 
Special Measures 
§ 1010.600 General. 
Each financial institution (as defined 
in 31 U.S.C. 5312(a)(2) or (c)(1)) should 
refer to its Chapter X Part for any ad-
ditional special standards of diligence; 
prohibitions; and special measures re-
quirements. 
