mission under the Securities Exchange 
Act of 1934 (15 U.S.C. 78a et seq.), except 
persons who register pursuant to sec-
tion 15(b)(11) of the Securities Ex-
change Act of 1934; 
(iii) A futures commission merchant 
or an introducing broker registered, or 
required to be registered, with the 
